{"id":10100,"name":"raichu-alola","speciesId":26,"dex":26,"form":"alolan","generation":1,"types":["electric","psychic"],"stats":{"hp":60,"attack":85,"defense":50,"special-attack":95,"special-defense":85,"speed":110},"abilities":[{"name":"surge-surfer","hidden":false}],"height":7,"weight":210,"baseExp":243,"sprites":{"normal":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/10100.png","shiny":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/shiny/10100.png","icon":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/10100.png"},"cry":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/10100.ogg","genus":"Mouse Pokémon","flavor":[{"version":"sword","text":"Its long tail serves as a ground to protect itself from its own high-voltage power."},{"version":"red","text":"Its long tail serves as a ground to protect itself from its own high voltage power."},{"version":"yellow","text":"When electricity builds up inside its body, it becomes feisty. It also glows in the dark."},{"version":"gold","text":"When its electric­ ity builds, its muscles are stimu­ lated, and it be­ comes more aggres­ sive than usual."},{"version":"silver","text":"If the electric pouches in its cheeks become fully charged, both ears will stand straight up."},{"version":"crystal","text":"If its electric pouches run empty, it raises its tail to gather electri­ city from the atmosphere."},{"version":"ruby","text":"If the electrical sacks become excessively charged, RAICHU plants its tail in the ground and discharges. Scorched patches of ground will be found near this POKéMON’s nest."},{"version":"sapphire","text":"This POKéMON exudes a weak electrical charge from all over its body that makes it take on a slight glow in darkness. RAICHU searches for electricity by planting its tail in the ground."},{"version":"emerald","text":"If it stores too much electricity, its behavior turns aggressive. To avoid this, it occasionally discharges excess energy and calms itself down."},{"version":"firered","text":"Its electric charges can reach even 100,000 volts. Careless contact can cause even an Indian elephant to faint."},{"version":"diamond","text":"It turns aggressive if it has too much electricity in its body. It discharges power through its tail."},{"version":"pearl","text":"It can loose 100,000-volt bursts of electricity, instantly downing foes several times its size."},{"version":"platinum","text":"Its tail discharges electricity into the ground, protecting it from getting shocked."},{"version":"heartgold","text":"When its electricity builds, its muscles are stimulated, and it becomes more aggressive than usual."},{"version":"omega-ruby","text":"If the electrical sacs become excessively charged, Raichu plants its tail in the ground and discharges. Scorched patches of ground will be found near this Pokémon’s nest."},{"version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"This Pokémon exudes a weak electrical charge from all over its body that makes it take on a slight glow in darkness. Raichu plants its tail in the ground to discharge electricity."},{"version":"sun","text":"It unleashes electric shocks that can reach 100,000 volts. When agitated, it can knock out even an Indian elephant."},{"version":"moon","text":"It becomes aggressive when it has electricity stored up. At such times, even its Trainer has to take care to avoid being attacked."},{"version":"ultra-sun","text":"As electricity builds up inside its body, it becomes more aggressive. One theory is that the electricity buildup is actually causing stress."},{"version":"ultra-moon","text":"Because so many Trainers like the way Pikachu looks, you don’t see this Pokémon very often."},{"version":"shield","text":"If its electric pouches run empty, it raises its tail to gather electricity from the atmosphere."},{"version":"legends-arceus","text":"It can discharge bursts of electricity exceeding 100,000 volts— a single strike with that amount of power would incapacitate one of the Copperajah of my homeland."}],"genderRate":4,"captureRate":75,"eggGroups":["ground","fairy"],"isLegendary":false,"isMythical":false,"evolution":{"species":"pichu","speciesId":172,"evolvesTo":[{"conditions":["Felicidade alta"],"species":"pikachu","speciesId":25,"evolvesTo":[{"conditions":["Usar Thunder Stone","Usar Thunder Stone"],"species":"raichu","speciesId":26,"evolvesTo":[]}]}]},"varieties":[{"id":26,"name":"raichu","form":"normal","sprite":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/26.png"},{"id":10100,"name":"raichu-alola","form":"alolan","sprite":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/10100.png"},{"id":10304,"name":"raichu-mega-x","form":"mega","sprite":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/10304.png"},{"id":10305,"name":"raichu-mega-y","form":"mega","sprite":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/10305.png"}],"games":[17,18,19,20,25],"moves":[{"id":5,"learn":[[20,"tm",0]]},{"id":6,"learn":[[19,"tm",0],[20,"tm",0]]},{"id":9,"learn":[[18,"tutor",0],[19,"tm",0],[20,"tm",0],[25,"tm",0]]},{"id":21,"learn":[[20,"lv",1]]},{"id":25,"learn":[[20,"tm",0]]},{"id":29,"learn":[[19,"tm",0]]},{"id":34,"learn":[[20,"tm",0],[25,"tm",0]]},{"id":36,"learn":[[25,"tm",0]]},{"id":39,"learn":[[17,"lv",1],[18,"lv",1],[19,"lv",1],[20,"lv",1],[25,"lv",1]]},{"id":45,"learn":[[19,"lv",1],[20,"lv",1],[25,"lv",1]]},{"id":57,"learn":[[20,"tm",0],[25,"tm",0]]},{"id":63,"learn":[[17,"tm",0],[18,"tm",0],[19,"tm",0],[20,"tm",0],[25,"tm",0]]},{"id":69,"learn":[[19,"tm",0]]},{"id":84,"learn":[[17,"lv",1],[18,"lv",1],[19,"lv",1],[20,"lv",1],[25,"lv",1]]},{"id":85,"learn":[[17,"lv",1],[17,"tm",0],[18,"lv",1],[18,"tm",0],[19,"tm",0],[20,"lv",1],[20,"tm",0],[25,"lv",5],[25,"tm",0]]},{"id":86,"lear